</p><p id="dcb8f289-871b-48ae-8624-f84c910172b3" class="">
</p><p id="8b9982ea-dc3c-4f5f-9b51-3b9c604f795f" class="">
</p><p id="2fd757c7-dfa5-4416-8cf8-e3e3ac305b37" class="">
</p><p id="b56d325c-b9d9-4aac-8cc1-4b74f84ab9d5" class="">
</p><p id="d2ee2610-3d62-4966-862f-dd3ef01d3f66" class="">
</p><details open=""><summary style="font-weight:600;font-size:1.5em;line-height:1.3;margin:0">13. [CSS고급]이미지 꾸미기(CSS Styling Images) - 모서리 둥글게, 폴라로이드 사진, 반응형 이미지</summary><div class="indented"><p id="66c35a0e-7de1-4eb7-9826-c63690ea3665" class="">
</p><hr id="20447c23-6dc2-4fad-a2f0-16ffcaa57a3f"/><p id="881e0395-2371-4236-9c5f-937c42c2001d" class="">많이 사용되는 이미지 꾸미기 방법을 알아봅니다.</p><p id="1e280467-14ae-4432-8817-28cf2058bdbd" class="">
</p><p id="bc525942-0b6f-4ab9-b110-712587585515" class="">
</p><h1 id="a246ba28-a08b-496b-9580-acd92d1724c0" class=""><strong>1. 이미지지 모서리 둥글게 만들기(Rounded Images)</strong></h1><p id="00b8c649-a60c-447d-9182-2e5cec9959fa" class="">border-radius 속성을 이용하면 이미지 모서리를 둥글게 만들거나 이미지 동그랗게 만들 수 있습니다.</p><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js" integrity="sha512-7Z9J3l1+EYfeaPKcGXu3MS/7T+w19WtKQY/n+xzmw4hZhJ9tyYmcUS+4QqAlzhicE5LAfMQSF3iFTK9bQdTxXg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css" integrity="sha512-tN7Ec6zAFaVSG3TpNAKtk4DOHNpSwKHxxrsiw4GHKESGPs5njn/0sMCUMl2svV4wo4BK/rCP7juYz+zx+l6oeQ==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><pre id="02d2270f-af6c-45a7-9ae6-b7a045363428" class="code"><code class="language-JavaScript">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
	&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
	&lt;style&gt;  
		img {margin:10px}
		#img1 { border-radius:10px }
		#img2 { border-radius:100% }
	&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;  
		&lt;img src=&quot;./img.jpg&quot; id=&quot;img1&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;
		&lt;img src=&quot;./img.jpg&quot; id=&quot;img2&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;/&gt;  
	&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre><figure id="5f69a0b8-21cf-47ae-a7bd-a4eafcc71722" class="image"><img style="width:606px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfMTM3/MDAxNzAwMTk2OTQ1MDgx.OpO6-tAEv3njNIL3Q0-Qahe9PyJLACyOVn0OEfa5LOkg.tI491eAuDdvq_r3CrEeCpLjHD1HTlAWOTMyhN_ywGZcg.JPEG.redoxup/p01.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><p id="60507ced-2587-4d69-b3c4-6d6ec4ca0070" class="">
</p><p id="4d9fb008-8766-4dbe-84be-b5886e4a1f6b" class="">
</p><h1 id="335af690-4aa4-443b-bc1b-40981a3c83c2" class=""><strong>2. 미리보기 이미지(Thumbnail Images)</strong></h1><p id="3fa58177-ff7b-4ef7-85ec-58cd6c692ac5" class="">border 속성을 이용하면 미리보기 이미지를 만들 수 있습니다.</p><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js" integrity="sha512-7Z9J3l1+EYfeaPKcGXu3MS/7T+w19WtKQY/n+xzmw4hZhJ9tyYmcUS+4QqAlzhicE5LAfMQSF3iFTK9bQdTxXg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css" integrity="sha512-tN7Ec6zAFaVSG3TpNAKtk4DOHNpSwKHxxrsiw4GHKESGPs5njn/0sMCUMl2svV4wo4BK/rCP7juYz+zx+l6oeQ==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><pre id="0307af4d-79b9-43ff-8558-d8a8254f2f63" class="code"><code class="language-JavaScript">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
	&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
	&lt;style&gt;  
		img {   
			border:1px solid #ddd ;border-radius:4px;
			padding:5px;
			width:150px; 
		}
		a img:hover { box-shadow:0 0 2px 1px rgba(0, 140, 186, 0.5) }
	&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;  
		&lt;img src=&quot;./img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;
		&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;./img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
	&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre><figure id="dd6904ad-161a-4eff-a145-7f4383aa3912" class="image"><img style="width:502px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfMTQ4/MDAxNzAwMTk3MDA5Mjk4.UdWzoXoMXzP88LouTmlTSdmHxUqGuF6X604O45LWTnMg.3aL6g2USfDgliuBa_I_iDelXL99tdeHRhl34i4NOsaMg.JPEG.redoxup/p02.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><p id="5e488ddb-0728-49f1-a108-e2990611e853" class="">링크되는 이미지의 경우 마우스를 오버했을 때 그림자가 나오도록 하였습니다.</p><p id="47e5c906-44c0-4e70-bfe0-068840e3b32a" class="">
</p><p id="8addcb57-3ec7-4b57-bdee-89d641e8aee8" class="">
</p><p id="d0fadf19-96bf-4c1d-95b2-b9d8918256ae" class="">
</p><h1 id="2280ae78-55c1-47e0-b2a9-70b906d130fc" class=""><strong>3. 반응형 이미지(Responsive Images)</strong></h1><p id="70b551d4-90b8-417f-ae0e-d8b785e2d8ec" class="">반응형 이미지는 화면의 크기에 맞게 이미지 크기가 조정되는 기술을 말합니다.</p><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js" integrity="sha512-7Z9J3l1+EYfeaPKcGXu3MS/7T+w19WtKQY/n+xzmw4hZhJ9tyYmcUS+4QqAlzhicE5LAfMQSF3iFTK9bQdTxXg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css" integrity="sha512-tN7Ec6zAFaVSG3TpNAKtk4DOHNpSwKHxxrsiw4GHKESGPs5njn/0sMCUMl2svV4wo4BK/rCP7juYz+zx+l6oeQ==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><pre id="d62c0c4c-eddb-42bd-a19a-27110430c34c" class="code"><code class="language-JavaScript">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
	&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
	&lt;style&gt;  
		img { max-width:100% ; height:auto }
	&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;  
		&lt;img src=&quot;./bg_img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt; 
	&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre><figure id="72922e70-8ac0-43aa-a3ce-c4a9a2caaf1c" class="image"><img style="width:693px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfNDQg/MDAxNzAwMTk3MDg1MzE0.xAVjai2c3MbGnfkfuIDwP1yeLzFM1e_a8-IE7a10mvsg.KUONJxKkU9j-UzZjnjlz71xeat8hbIMPUvgqLwBzXysg.JPEG.redoxup/p03.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><figure id="153bc867-7dfc-4d7d-8fc1-3f09e2213a97" class="image"><img style="width:502px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfMjg4/MDAxNzAwMTk3MDg1MzA1.Yr8t3U3K6EdmQ6Bqfw2mkQdZSB8oAXFe-tLl4gkKC1Eg.wCqJTwfxVPu_CUW5qVlPvwn6yJhcMsJUmPyOYKBGT_og.JPEG.redoxup/p04.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><p id="7ade53e6-a5b6-4b75-a606-cfc237c5e6d3" class="">반응형 이미지는 브라우저 크기를 늘렸다 줄였다 해보면 알 수 있습니다.</p><p id="79c43399-b6cf-4752-910e-c05ba824a586" class="">브라우저 크기에 따라 이미지를 축소하고 싶지만 원래 크기보다는 확대하고 싶지 않은 경우 사용하면 됩니다.</p><p id="cace8b4d-6a25-4f2d-ad9b-43f639583a7d" class="">
</p><p id="3b20537d-2ad9-4700-8e8e-9d84c5e820ca" class="">
</p><p id="1b9979ae-70eb-4589-8378-92cb455538fa" class="">
</p><h1 id="c45c3c50-eaf7-4ec8-870a-a7533ddbba78" class=""><strong>4. 이미지 중앙에 배치하기(Center an Image)</strong></h1><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js" integrity="sha512-7Z9J3l1+EYfeaPKcGXu3MS/7T+w19WtKQY/n+xzmw4hZhJ9tyYmcUS+4QqAlzhicE5LAfMQSF3iFTK9bQdTxXg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css" integrity="sha512-tN7Ec6zAFaVSG3TpNAKtk4DOHNpSwKHxxrsiw4GHKESGPs5njn/0sMCUMl2svV4wo4BK/rCP7juYz+zx+l6oeQ==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><pre id="9a652228-da7b-4400-873f-66d81cd211d3" class="code"><code class="language-JavaScript">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
	&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
	&lt;style&gt;  
		img {  
			display:block ;
			margin-left:auto ; 
			margin-right:auto 
		}
	&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;  
		&lt;img src=&quot;./img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt; 
	&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre><figure id="a303a72f-ebaa-4e40-976f-8c34f05b65cf" class="image"><img style="width:693px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfMzkg/MDAxNzAwMTk3MTQ4MTI5.GPtZ5nsKA4C56BuWwrPcaCwnF1mwNH8eyeK_PdpabVQg.YN_rwPM98ne4ZseVRIh81h-V5uEwZ8aKyFEKUSolVy0g.JPEG.redoxup/p05.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><p id="d3e2de91-ef19-492d-bc17-d6f4c95b75bc" class="">이미지를 중앙에 배치하고 싶다면 이미지를 블록으로 만들고(= display:block),</p><p id="373d5485-53d8-4405-a33c-c84ff695aaed" class="">좌우 여백을 auto로 해주면 됩니다.(= margin-left:auto ; margin-right:auto)</p><p id="7f386223-b25e-49ff-8323-5d0ad022a837" class="">
</p><p id="ce173c76-8a77-49cf-a86b-4c155c82c6b5" class="">
</p><p id="2a440824-cc6c-4828-915e-5471b66ea162" class="">
</p><h1 id="15455458-2f91-4353-8a0a-8869c66d15a2" class=""><strong>5. 폴라로이드 사진처럼 만들기(Polaroid Images &amp; Cards)</strong></h1><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js" integrity="sha512-7Z9J3l1+EYfeaPKcGXu3MS/7T+w19WtKQY/n+xzmw4hZhJ9tyYmcUS+4QqAlzhicE5LAfMQSF3iFTK9bQdTxXg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css" integrity="sha512-tN7Ec6zAFaVSG3TpNAKtk4DOHNpSwKHxxrsiw4GHKESGPs5njn/0sMCUMl2svV4wo4BK/rCP7juYz+zx+l6oeQ==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><pre id="cbc5b4fd-1d38-40f1-ae0a-1d63e6eedbe0" class="code"><code class="language-JavaScript">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
	&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
	&lt;style&gt;  
		.polaroid {
			width:80% ; background-color:#ffffff ;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2), 0 6px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.19);
			margin:20px auto
		} 
		.polaroid img { width:100% }
		.container { text-align:center ; padding:10px 20px }
	&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;  
		&lt;div class=&quot;polaroid&quot;&gt;
			&lt;img src=&quot;img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; &gt;
			&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
				&lt;p&gt;Photo&lt;/p&gt;
			&lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre><figure id="919bf5f8-e8a3-4ad2-a766-bd7e367d673b" class="image"><img style="width:678px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfMjQg/MDAxNzAwMTk3MjI1NjQx.o_8hxHQctO4vDe_nz5SY4ldCvB4t1VlPUvRGlF3YZOgg.QKi-fRJxS7Zyb2MmUpQ1iKPE-5u6ZqNSea86BMenhS8g.JPEG.redoxup/p06.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><figure id="a279a5b6-5e3b-406d-85f6-f97f2973884b" class="image"><img style="width:502px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfMjk5/MDAxNzAwMTk3MjI1NjMz.5z8H6xnr3uCNRZnrSIE-IqTU85sSd-qmHDAeOpqRKOsg.9TeU7pMNQih8KzfJP13kXO0DHtNTeOTphwUM2xKwsW8g.JPEG.redoxup/p07.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><p id="8f9fb488-7483-48a4-a19e-86524dacd421" class=""><strong>위 예제는 반응형으로 만들어졌다. 브라우저의 너비에 따라 폴라로이드 이미지가 다르게 보인다.</strong></p><p id="7a034ebd-e6ab-4060-b745-c7b8e01c9026" class=""><strong></strong></p><p id="c0b28dab-bdee-46ac-845b-e7c0cb3a113c" class=""><strong></strong></p><p id="2d47ba96-7ff5-4fc2-a2f2-3fbd7fcd7fc7" class=""><strong></strong></p><h1 id="7eec0f01-3bcd-4a50-b9e3-5850e46c16be" class="">6. 투명한 이미지(Transparent Image)</h1><p id="1351dc9d-2cf8-41f3-a973-c4c42f46ffc6" class=""><strong>opacity속성을 이용하면 이미지에 투명도를 줄수 있습니다.</strong></p><p id="a0ba35a1-e0ad-419f-a5d8-c35ad39de5c0" class=""><strong>입력 값은 0.0에서 1.0까지이며, 값이 낮을수록 투명해집니다.</strong></p><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js" integrity="sha512-7Z9J3l1+EYfeaPKcGXu3MS/7T+w19WtKQY/n+xzmw4hZhJ9tyYmcUS+4QqAlzhicE5LAfMQSF3iFTK9bQdTxXg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css" integrity="sha512-tN7Ec6zAFaVSG3TpNAKtk4DOHNpSwKHxxrsiw4GHKESGPs5njn/0sMCUMl2svV4wo4BK/rCP7juYz+zx+l6oeQ==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><pre id="b8ff2bd3-e3fb-42ef-a516-81458f26f99e" class="code"><code class="language-JavaScript">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
	&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
	&lt;style&gt;  
		img { margin:5px ; width:100px }
		#img1 { opacity:0.3 }
		#img2 { opacity:0.6 }
		#img3 { opacity:0.9 }
	&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;  
		&lt;img src=&quot;img.jpg&quot; id=&quot;img1&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;
		&lt;img src=&quot;img.jpg&quot; id=&quot;img2&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;
		&lt;img src=&quot;img.jpg&quot; id=&quot;img3&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;
	&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre><figure id="43153c05-2152-4b01-ae7a-ab181ec46c1e" class="image"><img style="width:502px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfODcg/MDAxNzAwMTk3MzIyNjk2.IyE_YWSg68ge_5TMdg0hx3z0Umorvy2DaYTawYKNweMg.ceffZdLLnZQ7y1_fzIvCG7OdYYJlPaswicyQWyu6GYgg.JPEG.redoxup/p08.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><p id="521c2d36-824a-4dc9-9672-f80a72b34c07" class=""><strong></strong></p><p id="4f6e3ad3-121d-46ed-aa87-8f90c76679f8" class=""><strong></strong></p><h1 id="ff34ed89-4c7c-4186-85ab-7a53f00d2a8f" class=""><strong>7. 이미지 텍스트(Image Text)</strong></h1><p id="9172e049-bbe0-4ba4-9db4-2376391ab107" class=""><strong>position속성을 이용하며 이미지 위에 텍스트를 배치할 수 있습니다.</strong></p><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js" integrity="sha512-7Z9J3l1+EYfeaPKcGXu3MS/7T+w19WtKQY/n+xzmw4hZhJ9tyYmcUS+4QqAlzhicE5LAfMQSF3iFTK9bQdTxXg==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css" integrity="sha512-tN7Ec6zAFaVSG3TpNAKtk4DOHNpSwKHxxrsiw4GHKESGPs5njn/0sMCUMl2svV4wo4BK/rCP7juYz+zx+l6oeQ==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><pre id="cf634a34-0154-4abd-93ec-5fb3462d6cd3" class="code"><code class="language-JavaScript">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
	&lt;head&gt;
	&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
	&lt;style&gt;  
		.container { position:relative }
		img { width:100% ; height:auto ; opacity:0.3 }
		.txt1 , .txt2 , .txt3 {
			position:absolute ;
			font-size:18px ; color:#000000
		}
		.txt1 { top:10px ; left:10px }
		.txt2 { top:50% ; left:50% ; transform:translate(-50%,-50%) }
		.txt3 { bottom:10px ; right:10px }
	&lt;/style&gt;
	&lt;/head&gt;
	&lt;body&gt;  
		&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
			&lt;img src=&quot;./bg_img.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;
			&lt;div class=&quot;txt1&quot;&gt;Top Left&lt;/div&gt;
			&lt;div class=&quot;txt2&quot;&gt;Center&lt;/div&gt;
			&lt;div class=&quot;txt3&quot;&gt;Bottom Right&lt;/div&gt;
		&lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre><figure id="fc74e07e-36d2-4e45-aeeb-532839aea27b" class="image"><img style="width:693px" src="https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMzExMTdfMzAg/MDAxNzAwMTk3Mzg4MDU2.kBWSuKBvXmiHXVTaOsyEPX8dB34z6BMs43tQQaEpwskg.llPnQpV9qJya2FLpHNIqsdVMtmzc_rmkKnr3uUGV6TIg.JPEG.redoxup/p09.jpg?type=w773"/></figure><p id="0df8c706-9b49-4600-b392-73b5a6db65c9" class=""><strong>원본에서는 더 많은 예제가 있지만, 중복되거나 앞으로 배울 내용들은 생략하였습니다.</strong></p><p id="9731ea6a-a660-4c86-b5f4-3547148f3b9c" class="">
</p><p id="f31aba1a-d732-443e-9809-ebc63facb71c" class="">
</p></div></details></div></article></body></html>